# docs/specs is a copy of the conductor's specs folder. Its briefs/ subdirectory holds
# dispatch briefs — orchestration records naming worktree paths, agent instructions and
# process — which are conductor-side only and must not ship. Excluded here so that
# re-copying the folder cannot re-add them.
docs/specs/briefs/
